 #:seon.task{:name "no-model-turn-without-an-assignment"
             :kind :function
             :intent "seon.turn/next-agent-work opens another model call after every successful reply (continuing-reply?) unless the last evaluation answered done or wait; only :seon.config.run/max-episode-runs (100) bounds it, and an agent without an assignment still gets model turns (error notifications to root open root turns too). Contradicts \"a model agent launches only on an assigned task with proofs\". Done when no model turn runs for an agent without an assigned task, with a test that an unassigned agent with a wake gets none."
