 #:seon.task{:name "a-model-pass-never-sees-its-test-step"
             :kind :function
             :intent "After a model pass that evaluated a form, `seon.turn/step` runs the proofs and reaching tests but offers the summary only on an MCP reply channel; the model's next prompt carries neither the summary nor the current-state block, so the model never learns its proof is still red (live-agent run, agent live-flash, default 6cc5dbbb4, 2026-10-08: nine passes, the agent learned the proof's status only by evaluating (seon.context/current-state) itself). Covered by the block-last assembly (ledger CS-03a) once it lands; done when a model pass's next prompt shows the proofs' status that pass's step recorded."
