             :must-read #{seon.turn/test-step seon.turn/summary seon.turn/summary-queue}}
 #:seon.task{:name "a-throwing-test-step-loses-its-cause"
             :kind :function
             :intent "When the automatic test step throws a non-refusal (a NullPointerException inside seon.test/changes while lane test-step worked, 2026-10-09), seon.turn/test-step answers only {:seon.error/message \"The automatic test step threw; the pass's values stand.\" :seon.error/exception-class \"java.lang.NullPointerException\"}: no cause chain, no throw site, so the agent and root cannot tell which owner failed without a debug build. A deliberate translation keeps the cause. Done when the step's error carries the cause chain (`:seon.error/chain`) of the thrown exception and a reply test asserts it names the throwing function."
             :must-read #{seon.turn/test-step seon.error.refusal/diagnostic}}
